      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A study of the structural aspects of blood serum albumin in patients with different forms of IHD and non-coronarogenous diseases of the myocardium revealed a reduction of spiralization of the albumin molecule, formation of modified form of protein and albumin-carbohydrate complexes. It is recommended to use these biochemical parameters in the complex diagnosis of different forms of cardiac pathology."},
